WEBVTT

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:09.230
Release group MANIA presents

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:09.230
http://doramamania.mybb.ru

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:09.230
http://vk.com/doramamania

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:17.930
Project coordinator and song translator: Nemie

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:17.840
Final episode

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:27.930
Translators: Nemie, Kaia, tamaramin

00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:33.930
Beta Editor: Sana

00:00:34.070 --> 00:00:37.070
Will you hear him?

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:42.620
The same voice that is in such a hurry to confess

00:00:41.590 --> 00:00:44.730
I'll show you something good as a gift

00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:46.520
Are you still listening?

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:50.670
Can you hear my heart?

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:56.790
How raindrops settled on the window

00:00:57.470 --> 00:01:03.240
Also my mind is consumed by you

00:01:03.990 --> 00:01:05.440
Need you

00:01:06.450 --> 00:01:09.130
The Emperor forbade us to hold an official ceremony

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:08.120
Need you

00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:11.390
I miss you

00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:11.880
But I secretly prepared something

00:01:13.310 --> 00:01:14.390
Are you upset?

00:01:14.390 --> 00:01:15.810
That's more than enough

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:23.310
Don't worry

00:01:23.310 --> 00:01:25.440
I just wanted to get you out of the palace

00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:28.080
Even though we are married, I will consider us friends

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:30.010
I'm not worried about that

00:01:30.010 --> 00:01:33.700
It will be quiet and cozy in these chambers,
because they are located far from the main house

00:01:33.700 --> 00:01:37.360
My house is nearby, come whenever you want

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:41.590
Oh, and also this...

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:48.860
Thanks for saying you want this

00:01:54.700 --> 00:01:57.700
Will you hear him?

00:01:57.950 --> 00:02:03.250
The same voice that is in such a hurry to confess

00:02:04.700 --> 00:02:07.150
Are you still listening?

00:02:07.150 --> 00:02:11.300
Can you hear my heart?

00:02:13.150 --> 00:02:17.420
How raindrops settled on the window

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:23.870
Also my mind is consumed by you

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:24.220
It happened that I would reach the very sources of the stream,
Sitting down, I contemplate how the clouds rise in the distance

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:26.070
Need you

00:02:27.170 --> 00:02:28.750
Need you

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:32.020
I miss you

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:53.990
Damn!

00:03:01.350 --> 00:03:03.930
Wow, practicing your sword skills again?

00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:07.160
I thought you were good at it

00:03:13.150 --> 00:03:17.110
Here. Let's see how kind you are to your husband

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:27.230
Okay, that's enough, let's go inside.

00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:31.110
The court physician leaves his position,
I asked him to stop by on his way home

00:03:31.110 --> 00:03:32.470
Doctor?

00:03:34.220 --> 00:03:35.590
But I'm fine

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:38.670
You've suffered a lot, so you need a healer

00:03:38.670 --> 00:03:39.680
Let's go

00:04:00.210 --> 00:04:05.590
Until the time you left the palace, I did not feel the child's pulse

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:08.440
- But now...
- It was too early

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:12.250
You wouldn't know

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:14.470
Child? So you're saying...

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:18.510
As I said earlier,

00:04:18.510 --> 00:04:21.500
your heartbeat is palpitating, your health is not good

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:24.440
Because of the child you have become weaker

00:04:25.170 --> 00:04:27.950
If you insist on keeping the child...

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:29.200
It's okay

00:04:30.340 --> 00:04:33.910
If the child is safe, nothing else matters.

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:35.210
Why do you say that?!

00:04:37.070 --> 00:04:38.900
You have to keep it a secret

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:42.890
Please delay your return and stay here for a while.

00:04:42.890 --> 00:04:44.120
Okay

00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:48.000
Lady, you shouldn't stand in the cold wind

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:50.290
You should stay in bed

00:04:57.580 --> 00:05:00.610
Baek Ah said that their marriage is just a formality

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:01.910
However...

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:04.740
look at this

00:05:05.330 --> 00:05:07.530
"The 14th Prince's wife watched as

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:10.790
how the prince trained with the sword for a long time"

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:14.360
"They held hands and took care of each other"!

00:05:15.740 --> 00:05:19.670
Your Majesty, don't you know Miss Su?

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:22.850
She was friends with Jeong when she was young

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:25.830
It has many striking features

00:05:25.830 --> 00:05:29.310
She communicates equally with both men and women

00:05:50.130 --> 00:05:51.310
Su!

00:05:52.130 --> 00:05:53.210
Su!

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:59.410
Why did you come here?
Cold wind can harm your baby

00:05:59.410 --> 00:06:00.870
Get up

00:06:49.440 --> 00:06:52.690
She asked me not to worry and sleep peacefully

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:57.550
This is the first time I've slept in the same room as my wife.

00:06:57.550 --> 00:06:59.260
Why are you pushing me?

00:07:00.760 --> 00:07:05.220
Now when I look at you, I see that you and I have matured

00:07:06.130 --> 00:07:07.880
A lot of time has passed

00:07:07.880 --> 00:07:11.090
There are good times and there are bad times

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:15.570
So many days have passed

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:21.180
I've been old enough to understand this

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:25.430
Do you remember our first meeting?

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:30.130
Was this in the 8th Prince's library?

00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:36.920
Or when I saved you?

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:40.680
Are you talking about when you came running to me with a stick?

00:07:42.700 --> 00:07:44.710
I was shocked then

00:07:44.710 --> 00:07:47.700
I've never seen such a brave girl

00:07:48.340 --> 00:07:50.520
And when did you fight with Eun?

00:07:50.520 --> 00:07:53.000
I always laugh when I think about it

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:58.140
Your head was a complete mess, and Eun had a bruise on his face

00:07:58.140 --> 00:08:01.400
-You were full of energy
- Was

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:05.240
Why didn't you keep your promise that you would sing for my birthday?

00:08:05.240 --> 00:08:08.040
- I waited every year
- Lord

00:08:08.040 --> 00:08:11.660
Okay, I'll sing this year

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:13.880
Do you remember?

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:17.520
You snuck into the bathhouse and spied on us

00:08:17.520 --> 00:08:19.580
Why did you do this?

00:08:20.490 --> 00:08:23.750
If you think about it, you were cunning even at that age

00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:25.890
It's not fair

00:08:25.890 --> 00:08:28.260
I was so surprised that I didn't see anything

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:31.190
Don't lie! You saw everything, right?

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:32.610
I really didn't see

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:38.110
No, what's wrong with my body?

00:08:56.220 --> 00:09:00.320
I'm still looking at you from the outside

00:09:01.650 --> 00:09:06.680
From now on, I am no longer interested in news about Jeong and Hae Soo

00:09:03.440 --> 00:09:10.590
It seemed to me that you are my love

00:09:08.570 --> 00:09:11.850
Make sure I don't hear from them again

00:09:10.920 --> 00:09:15.320
I kept thinking that you feel the same way

00:09:16.170 --> 00:09:21.040
Although you look the other way

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:30.570
Like the wind, like dust

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:36.320
I can't catch you and see you

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:40.740
Finally, it's just the two of us left here.

00:09:36.820 --> 00:09:44.970
Do you remember: I love, I love

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:43.560
You and me

00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:46.180
just you and me

00:09:44.970 --> 00:09:51.240
I believe there was love, I’ll call it fate

00:09:48.660 --> 00:09:50.760
Now I can forget about truth and lies

00:09:50.930 --> 00:09:53.190
misunderstanding and jealousy,

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:59.320
Do you remember: I love, I love

00:09:53.700 --> 00:09:57.930
dangerous struggle for the throne and death

00:09:58.300 --> 00:10:01.440
Now I can devote my time

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:06.040
In your eyes, I settled in your gaze

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:03.440
love for you

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:12.420
And I can only answer you:

00:10:13.220 --> 00:10:19.720
Hold me if I'm swinging

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:22.940
my love

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:30.420
my love

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:38.860
my love

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:52.260
In about six months

00:11:05.790 --> 00:11:08.680
What's wrong with my wife? Why did she give birth so early?

00:11:08.680 --> 00:11:11.370
After all, your daughter was born healthy

00:11:12.010 --> 00:11:14.320
She is very beautiful

00:11:15.270 --> 00:11:18.500
The child was stillborn

00:11:19.200 --> 00:11:20.400
Do you understand?

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:22.550
Take her to the nurse

00:11:23.310 --> 00:11:24.980
You gotta watch your words

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:51.320
Don't worry about the baby

00:11:51.320 --> 00:11:54.430
She is very beautiful and healthy.
Heaven blessed her

00:11:54.430 --> 00:11:57.830
I'll find her the best nurse in the area.

00:11:57.830 --> 00:11:59.720
What a joy

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:10.010
So stop worrying about the baby, think about yourself.

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:13.820
You must definitely restore your health

00:12:23.120 --> 00:12:25.010
I have a favor to ask

00:12:30.360 --> 00:12:34.740
to His Majesty

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:39.430
Do you want to show the child to the emperor?

00:12:45.490 --> 00:12:46.960
I...

00:12:48.960 --> 00:12:50.620
I want to see him

00:12:56.970 --> 00:12:58.330
Okay

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:07.530
Send this to the emperor.
Let him read it as soon as possible

00:13:07.530 --> 00:13:08.560
Okay

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:10.780
Stop!

00:13:16.820 --> 00:13:19.460
My wife's handwriting is like the emperor's

00:13:19.710 --> 00:13:21.030
It will look weird

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:33.640
The distribution of rice to clans should be modified

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:36.380
If someone has less,

00:14:36.380 --> 00:14:38.050
they will be weaker

00:14:38.050 --> 00:14:39.920
Everything the clans have

00:14:39.920 --> 00:14:42.220
- land and slaves

00:14:42.240 --> 00:14:46.940
Your Majesty, the 14th Prince has sent you a letter

00:15:00.780 --> 00:15:02.990
He never tires of writing letters

00:15:08.230 --> 00:15:10.100
You won't read it?

00:15:10.100 --> 00:15:12.470
I'm sure he has a lot of resentment towards me

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:15.140
I don't want to read it and be upset

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:18.760
He said he had a message for you

00:15:18.760 --> 00:15:20.570
I even sent someone

00:15:20.570 --> 00:15:23.050
Do I look like the type of person who has time for meetings?

00:15:24.110 --> 00:15:25.430
Forgive me

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:46.460
Has he arrived yet?

00:15:52.710 --> 00:15:55.210
I wrote so many letters...

00:15:58.780 --> 00:16:01.150
Does he hate me that much?

00:16:06.780 --> 00:16:08.780
Send someone else

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:14.280
If you give him my message, he will come

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:16.530
I did it, but...

00:16:18.980 --> 00:16:22.370
Yes, I forgot. I'll send someone else

00:16:26.410 --> 00:16:29.990
Let's go out. You have to feel happy to get better.

00:16:29.990 --> 00:16:33.450
I brought the most famous musicians from Songak

00:16:33.890 --> 00:16:36.170
And captured the peonies

00:16:37.110 --> 00:16:38.260
Don't you want to see them?

00:16:40.880 --> 00:16:43.100
Peonies?

00:16:51.750 --> 00:16:53.810
Is there a song you'd like to hear?

00:16:59.770 --> 00:17:01.640
Play your best song

00:17:01.640 --> 00:17:03.720
One courtier was the emperor's lover

00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:08.120
They say this song made him fall in love with her

00:17:08.870 --> 00:17:10.000
Emperor?

00:17:14.270 --> 00:17:16.270
I want to listen

00:18:45.610 --> 00:18:47.250
I love you

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:03.490
Once upon a time

00:19:05.750 --> 00:19:10.070
you promised that you would treat my life as your own

00:19:12.550 --> 00:19:14.740
Remember this?

00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:23.960
My daughter...

00:19:26.770 --> 00:19:28.200
protect her

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:32.960
instead of me

00:19:36.010 --> 00:19:38.720
You can't let her go to the palace

00:19:42.510 --> 00:19:44.030
Why do you say such things?

00:19:49.350 --> 00:19:51.590
He won't come

00:20:11.420 --> 00:20:12.530
Su

00:20:13.430 --> 00:20:26.790
The flower will fall to the ground, it withered

00:20:14.470 --> 00:20:16.420
In the next life

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:20.530
you will remember me, right?

00:20:23.230 --> 00:20:25.250
I will forget you

00:20:27.420 --> 00:20:40.690
He will be all alone, so sad

00:20:27.670 --> 00:20:30.020
I want to forget everything

00:20:34.850 --> 00:20:37.050
Even in my dreams...

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:42.290
I want to forget

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:54.630
The sky will lose its stars, it will instantly become sad

00:20:55.340 --> 00:21:09.080
And suddenly it starts crying like a little rain

00:21:09.080 --> 00:21:22.470
It feels like a flower blooms and then withers

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:39.730
If so, come back

00:21:48.020 --> 00:21:49.100
Su...

00:21:51.320 --> 00:21:53.540
didn't hate me that much...

00:21:56.670 --> 00:21:59.380
Apparently she sent you letters

00:22:00.580 --> 00:22:02.250
Haven't you read them?

00:22:44.740 --> 00:22:47.070
Our life is like a dream

00:22:47.650 --> 00:22:51.290
Right and wrong. Love and hate

00:22:51.320 --> 00:22:55.400
All this dies over time, quietly disappears without a trace.

00:22:56.660 --> 00:23:01.550
Are you still angry about love and holding grudges?

00:23:02.720 --> 00:23:06.120
I was constantly worried

00:23:06.120 --> 00:23:09.230
that I could leave you with hatred instead of love,

00:23:09.630 --> 00:23:13.320
not allowing you to rest

00:23:27.260 --> 00:23:29.140
I still love you

00:23:29.930 --> 00:23:33.770
When you gave up everything and stood next to me in the rain...

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:38.540
When you shielded me with your body from a flying arrow...

00:23:38.650 --> 00:23:41.580
I can never forget you

00:23:43.760 --> 00:23:48.810
The opposite of love is not hate

00:23:48.810 --> 00:23:51.040
It's giving up on someone

00:23:52.740 --> 00:23:54.240
I was afraid you'd think

00:23:54.600 --> 00:23:56.510
that I abandoned you,

00:23:56.930 --> 00:24:02.110
so you give up on me

00:24:03.080 --> 00:24:05.780
I missed you so much...

00:24:05.810 --> 00:24:08.720
but I couldn't be there

00:24:09.450 --> 00:24:13.420
I hope one day we meet again in the garden

00:24:13.420 --> 00:24:18.460
I will wait for you every day

00:25:05.820 --> 00:25:07.440
Su!

00:25:09.690 --> 00:25:12.400
Where is Su? Where is she?!

00:25:13.780 --> 00:25:15.030
Su...

00:25:16.470 --> 00:25:19.350
Stop playing around and come out. Su...

00:25:19.350 --> 00:25:22.240
Su! Where are you?

00:25:22.240 --> 00:25:24.310
Where are you?!

00:25:24.310 --> 00:25:26.410
Su! Su!

00:25:32.830 --> 00:25:35.320
What have you been doing all this time?

00:25:36.000 --> 00:25:38.640
Don't pretend you're sad

00:25:45.350 --> 00:25:47.120
You brought it to this

00:25:47.670 --> 00:25:49.890
Your name was written on the envelopes!

00:25:50.920 --> 00:25:53.890
I didn't know there were letters from Su inside!

00:25:54.750 --> 00:25:58.410
I did this because you and her have similar handwriting

00:25:59.180 --> 00:26:02.050
But you should have known that Su was dying

00:26:02.050 --> 00:26:05.020
I know you have someone who has been following us!

00:26:05.020 --> 00:26:09.430
You shared the same chambers and got along well

00:26:09.430 --> 00:26:12.320
He stopped giving reports about you

00:26:43.240 --> 00:26:46.470
Su... let's go

00:26:47.940 --> 00:26:49.070
Let's go

00:26:52.120 --> 00:26:55.460
No you can't! No way! She is my wife!!!

00:26:56.000 --> 00:26:57.280
Out of the way

00:26:58.280 --> 00:27:02.340
Su may be dead, but she's my person

00:27:03.290 --> 00:27:07.400
Jeong, you should know! Better than anyone!

00:27:08.650 --> 00:27:10.930
Do you know who Su would like to be with?

00:27:27.420 --> 00:27:31.800
If you really consider Su a friend, stop fighting the emperor.

00:27:33.070 --> 00:27:37.800
Hae Soo spent her life stuck among us

00:27:37.800 --> 00:27:39.900
She couldn't afford a lot of things

00:27:42.350 --> 00:27:47.080
Still... do you want to make her even sadder?

00:28:05.230 --> 00:28:06.550
Are you...

00:28:09.270 --> 00:28:10.510
Su

00:28:14.180 --> 00:28:15.740
How stupid

00:28:25.140 --> 00:28:30.520
I hide my tears deep inside

00:28:31.370 --> 00:28:37.170
I want to forget everything about you

00:28:37.920 --> 00:28:44.470
It's time for us to leave the fate that brought us together

00:28:44.470 --> 00:28:52.820
Even though we will have to live in tears

00:28:46.270 --> 00:28:48.750
I'm not alone so I'm okay

00:28:52.790 --> 00:28:55.390
You are here, Your Highness, so why am I alone?

00:28:52.940 --> 00:28:58.940
As if a free wind will carry you away

00:28:58.940 --> 00:29:06.420
I kept looking for the way to you, but I never found it

00:29:03.760 --> 00:29:05.870
I won't leave

00:29:06.420 --> 00:29:14.320
I couldn’t catch the fate that was moving away from me

00:29:14.640 --> 00:29:19.560
So I'll let you go completely

00:29:25.370 --> 00:29:27.810
I won't leave

00:29:44.580 --> 00:29:45.840
Let me in!

00:29:49.040 --> 00:29:51.140
I am the one who could be the emperor!

00:29:51.140 --> 00:29:53.940
If you want to kill me, then hang me in front of Jeongdeokjeong!

00:30:00.490 --> 00:30:04.020
Are you asking me to kill myself?

00:30:12.420 --> 00:30:13.450
What?

00:30:14.380 --> 00:30:18.230
The Emperor sent to see if I was dead or not?

00:30:18.230 --> 00:30:20.590
I came to deliver something

00:30:22.260 --> 00:30:23.790
Hae Soo asked for this

00:30:30.890 --> 00:30:32.570
She died a long time ago

00:30:32.570 --> 00:30:37.580
She asked me to give you a letter from Chae Ryung

00:30:39.450 --> 00:30:41.570
There's nothing more I can do for you

00:30:42.870 --> 00:30:44.120
Sorry

00:31:11.710 --> 00:31:15.180
I know the end is near

00:31:15.180 --> 00:31:18.750
But this chance...

00:31:20.100 --> 00:31:22.120
May I come with you, your highness?

00:31:23.470 --> 00:31:26.390
I don't know when else I'll get the chance to leave the palace.

00:31:26.390 --> 00:31:31.080
I’m just such a person - if I fall in love, I can’t stop loving

00:31:31.330 --> 00:31:33.330
That's how stupid it is

00:31:37.250 --> 00:31:39.600
Chae Ryung has no regrets

00:31:40.230 --> 00:31:42.470
I'm not mad at anyone

00:31:44.270 --> 00:31:47.780
Is there any point in what we are doing...

00:31:47.890 --> 00:31:50.150
Only we ourselves can answer

00:32:04.390 --> 00:32:05.890
Silly

00:32:07.990 --> 00:32:10.220
Why don't you hate me?

00:32:11.660 --> 00:32:12.770
Why?

00:32:13.370 --> 00:32:20.340
Prince Wang Won was sentenced to death for treason

00:32:44.100 --> 00:32:46.000
My father will catch you

00:32:55.390 --> 00:32:57.120
You're Uka's daughter, right?

00:32:59.110 --> 00:33:02.100
I'm your uncle, your 13th uncle

00:33:02.100 --> 00:33:05.320
Liar. You look like a street musician

00:33:06.500 --> 00:33:07.990
I'm telling the truth

00:33:08.780 --> 00:33:10.040
What's your name?

00:33:10.040 --> 00:33:12.260
Name? Bok Soon

00:33:13.900 --> 00:33:16.320
What's your name? Zhong Ziqi?

00:33:16.320 --> 00:33:18.040
- Bok Soon
- Wu Hee!

00:33:18.040 --> 00:33:20.150
It's time for us to go to our rooms!

00:33:20.150 --> 00:33:21.710
Yes, okay

00:33:25.370 --> 00:33:27.510
Bok... Sun?

00:33:28.170 --> 00:33:34.620
Because I'm next to you, I'm very happy

00:33:35.640 --> 00:33:42.240
Because I'm next to you, I keep dreaming

00:33:43.220 --> 00:33:50.860
Because I'm next to you, I smile so brightly

00:33:43.400 --> 00:33:45.590
Is this the talisman of the seven stars of the Big Dipper?

00:33:46.980 --> 00:33:48.370
Where did you get it?

00:33:48.370 --> 00:33:51.300
I don't know.
He was always with me

00:33:50.860 --> 00:33:56.740
For you to be mine, I always pray to the Gods

00:33:53.150 --> 00:33:55.070
My favorite thing

00:33:58.400 --> 00:34:05.140
If you see my love and my feelings

00:34:06.170 --> 00:34:13.040
If you find my love and the path to me

00:34:13.680 --> 00:34:22.220
I will give my heart completely

00:34:18.760 --> 00:34:23.950
Right now I really want to not be associated with Hubaekje

00:34:22.220 --> 00:34:31.460
If you can stay with me for the rest of your life

00:34:25.680 --> 00:34:31.410
I am yours with all my heart

00:34:36.370 --> 00:34:41.010
I'm with you

00:34:44.150 --> 00:34:49.900
All with you

00:35:02.600 --> 00:35:07.450
I heard you still have no plans to get married, you spend your time in the fields

00:35:10.740 --> 00:35:15.010
If there were no worries, how boring would life be?

00:35:24.230 --> 00:35:28.990
The Emperor spends his time reading "Fundamentals of Politics in the Zhenguan Era"

00:35:29.580 --> 00:35:31.570
Now he's using his sword

00:35:34.110 --> 00:35:37.730
He frees the slaves and returns their titles and titles

00:35:39.360 --> 00:35:42.160
Takes power from powerful clans

00:35:42.940 --> 00:35:46.570
You are still interested in what is happening in the palace, as usual

00:35:47.530 --> 00:35:49.380
I'm just watching

00:35:51.750 --> 00:35:52.940
This is So

00:35:54.050 --> 00:35:57.070
It's interesting to see what kind of emperor he became

00:36:00.260 --> 00:36:01.430
Interesting...

00:36:02.980 --> 00:36:06.870
maybe Goryeo rules now
strongest emperor in history

00:36:09.700 --> 00:36:12.270
He had to try hard

00:36:27.070 --> 00:36:28.170
Recently...

00:36:29.760 --> 00:36:32.370
I realized that there are faces that cannot be forgotten

00:36:32.370 --> 00:36:36.350
Do you still miss Hae Soo?

00:36:44.600 --> 00:36:45.770
Who knows

00:36:55.980 --> 00:37:01.020
I've always... given my heart

00:37:02.570 --> 00:37:05.140
I've made a lot of mistakes in my life

00:37:09.600 --> 00:37:11.510
Only now I realized it

00:37:50.790 --> 00:37:52.360
Today is his birthday...

00:37:52.360 --> 00:37:55.520
How can you never go to Zhu?

00:37:56.240 --> 00:37:59.400
It will be enough if you just visit him

00:37:59.400 --> 00:38:01.340
He's afraid of his own father

00:38:01.340 --> 00:38:06.360
You treat him as your opponent, Your Majesty

00:38:06.360 --> 00:38:11.190
You have already gotten rid of your nephews Gyeongchongwon and Heunghwagun...

00:38:11.880 --> 00:38:14.190
At least trust your son

00:38:16.150 --> 00:38:17.550
Listen, Empress

00:38:18.940 --> 00:38:22.940
I see right through people who hide their true selves under invisible masks.

00:38:23.550 --> 00:38:25.910
Both you and this child...

00:38:26.650 --> 00:38:29.630
I know very well that one day you will reach me

00:38:32.270 --> 00:38:37.570
So... you still only remember her?

00:38:45.070 --> 00:38:48.490
Hae Soo was the only one who said that we are all equal

00:38:49.520 --> 00:38:52.960
You freed the slaves because you can't forget her

00:38:52.960 --> 00:38:55.070
Did you think I didn't know?

00:38:55.070 --> 00:38:56.870
Let's assume that's the case

00:38:56.870 --> 00:39:01.060
But even if you know it

00:39:01.060 --> 00:39:03.190
will something change?

00:39:10.060 --> 00:39:14.580
Now that I think about it, I understand why Hae Soo left.

00:39:15.820 --> 00:39:17.660
I know the reason

00:39:41.960 --> 00:39:43.200
Dad!

00:39:44.170 --> 00:39:45.690
Don't run, you'll hurt yourself!

00:39:58.390 --> 00:40:00.130
You crashed into me

00:40:08.580 --> 00:40:09.820
Who do we have here?

00:40:15.250 --> 00:40:16.780
Dad!

00:40:23.390 --> 00:40:24.930
Hello Your Majesty

00:40:32.600 --> 00:40:37.300
You shouldn't leave Jeongju, but you came to the palace?

00:40:37.300 --> 00:40:39.100
Today is the anniversary of Su...

00:40:39.510 --> 00:40:40.980
Forgive me

00:40:40.980 --> 00:40:44.330
For a second I lost my mind, this won't happen again

00:40:45.260 --> 00:40:46.610
Is she your daughter?

00:40:49.810 --> 00:40:50.820
Yes

00:40:54.010 --> 00:40:57.470
Your family asked for permission to marry you, I decided to give consent

00:40:58.280 --> 00:40:59.340
However...

00:41:03.480 --> 00:41:05.120
your daughter is old enough

00:41:07.800 --> 00:41:09.090
How old is she?

00:41:09.090 --> 00:41:11.090
I'm sure you're busy with government affairs

00:41:11.090 --> 00:41:13.500
Why do you care about my child?

00:41:14.010 --> 00:41:15.330
Come with me

00:41:18.290 --> 00:41:19.520
Stop

00:41:37.050 --> 00:41:38.840
Leave the child

00:41:49.450 --> 00:41:51.950
I can't unless you kill me

00:41:54.290 --> 00:41:55.350
Really?

00:41:56.840 --> 00:41:57.970
This child...

00:42:00.960 --> 00:42:03.520
She asked that the girl not live in the palace

00:42:04.950 --> 00:42:06.730
It's very scary and lonely there

00:42:07.490 --> 00:42:09.490
She said she didn't want that fate for her.

00:42:14.190 --> 00:42:18.680
Hae Soo cared only about this until her death

00:42:52.250 --> 00:42:54.180
14th Prince, Wang Jong

00:42:57.900 --> 00:42:59.950
Your link has expired

00:43:08.770 --> 00:43:11.080
I wish you could go to the palace right now

00:43:58.170 --> 00:44:00.870
Do you want to leave that bad?

00:44:01.530 --> 00:44:02.550
Yes

00:44:03.690 --> 00:44:05.460
I can't help but think about him

00:44:08.970 --> 00:44:10.440
You promised me something else

00:44:11.360 --> 00:44:15.360
He said that you will only be the emperor's man, no one else

00:44:16.550 --> 00:44:17.590
Yes

00:44:18.860 --> 00:44:21.500
However, I think there was only one emperor for me

00:44:23.170 --> 00:44:26.660
He was a brother and friend to me

00:44:28.190 --> 00:44:29.540
and ruler

00:44:35.590 --> 00:44:39.720
Speaking of Ms. Hae Soo, I don't think she was from this world

00:44:40.730 --> 00:44:43.980
If you think back to the past, you remember many examples

00:44:43.980 --> 00:44:45.970
So you should forget her

00:44:45.970 --> 00:44:50.550
If you think about a person you can't reach, you'll end up like me

00:45:18.230 --> 00:45:19.770
Have you seen it?

00:46:24.320 --> 00:46:27.180
Then...should I call you "my man"?

00:46:30.170 --> 00:46:32.760
You are my only empress

00:47:13.420 --> 00:47:15.350
What is this again?

00:47:17.060 --> 00:47:19.380
Seriously, who is he to make me cry again?

00:47:32.320 --> 00:47:36.540
Goryeo Era Makeup Art

00:47:35.340 --> 00:47:38.840
Buddhism influenced Goryeo
people began to wash their eyes and take baths

00:47:38.840 --> 00:47:43.360
Bath products and cosmetics began to appear during this era

00:47:43.360 --> 00:47:46.890
Writer Seo Kun from the Song Empire traveled to Goryeo, after which he reflected in his book...

00:47:48.250 --> 00:47:51.270
I had the same dream for a year

00:47:51.270 --> 00:47:54.640
A man with a long scar on his face

00:47:54.640 --> 00:47:56.310
He hid it with a mask, like this

00:47:57.230 --> 00:47:59.050
He was dressed in ancient robes

00:47:59.050 --> 00:48:01.340
It's because you escaped death

00:48:01.340 --> 00:48:04.260
You almost drowned, and when you were rescued, you came to your senses only a year later

00:48:04.260 --> 00:48:06.730
I'm fine now

00:48:11.050 --> 00:48:13.660
I don't know why I dreamed about him

00:48:15.130 --> 00:48:17.550
I cried so much

00:48:23.360 --> 00:48:26.680
The ingredients were ground into powder,
to make something like a face mask

00:48:27.250 --> 00:48:29.930
They could go to the market
to buy things from Bulgaria

00:48:30.760 --> 00:48:34.500
Bulgarian roses were sold there

00:48:34.500 --> 00:48:38.680
The amazing thing was that they created cosmetics from these flowers

00:48:53.270 --> 00:48:54.910
Hello

00:49:04.600 --> 00:49:05.860
Go Ha Jin

00:49:05.860 --> 00:49:07.810
- Your surname is Guo?
- What?

00:49:09.050 --> 00:49:11.750
Yes, yes, my name is Go Ha Jin

00:49:12.220 --> 00:49:15.860
Did you know that during Goryeo times, Go's last name was pronounced Hae?

00:49:15.860 --> 00:49:18.130
How's that?

00:49:18.130 --> 00:49:21.290
We just sell cosmetics from the Goryeo era.

00:49:21.290 --> 00:49:23.010
Funny coincidence

00:49:23.010 --> 00:49:25.020
Accidents are not accidental

00:49:25.020 --> 00:49:27.670
Everything just goes back to normal

00:49:28.480 --> 00:49:29.530
What?

00:49:32.130 --> 00:49:34.920
The smell of roses is so strong in here

00:49:34.920 --> 00:49:39.090
And, our products contain a lot of rose oil

00:49:39.090 --> 00:49:40.430
Especially in this serum

00:49:41.310 --> 00:49:44.300
It is made using Bulgarian rose oil and Houttuynia cordata extract.

00:49:44.350 --> 00:49:47.310
This is Bulgarian rose oil.
You didn't use it, did you?

00:49:56.020 --> 00:49:58.590
-Are you okay?
- What?

00:50:00.010 --> 00:50:01.770
Nothing like that

00:50:03.740 --> 00:50:08.220
If used regularly,
the skin will be in excellent condition

00:50:09.900 --> 00:50:14.120
Did you know that during the Goryeo era
Was there something like a BB cream?

00:50:14.120 --> 00:50:15.960
Men use it a lot these days...

00:50:15.960 --> 00:50:17.440
So now get ready

00:50:17.440 --> 00:50:21.280
I'll never let you go

00:50:27.460 --> 00:50:29.050
I think you need to rest

00:50:30.150 --> 00:50:31.710
What's wrong with me?

00:50:33.250 --> 00:50:35.950
You better leave.
Don't worry and go home

00:50:35.950 --> 00:50:37.110
I'll change the menu

00:50:38.380 --> 00:50:39.810
Sorry

00:50:46.510 --> 00:50:50.600
Paintings from the Goryeo era

00:51:08.060 --> 00:51:10.440
Grab them immediately!

00:51:40.350 --> 00:51:42.390
Gwangjong?

00:51:46.880 --> 00:51:49.050
It wasn't a dream

00:51:50.630 --> 00:51:52.390
This is not a dream

00:51:53.530 --> 00:51:56.430
You are so generous, Your Majesty!

00:51:56.430 --> 00:51:59.550
Don't worry, I'll save you

00:52:12.210 --> 00:52:16.310
Wow! Will you enjoy it alone, brother?

00:52:39.690 --> 00:52:42.490
She's mine.
This girl belongs to me

00:52:42.490 --> 00:52:43.750
So now get ready

00:52:43.750 --> 00:52:46.190
I'll never let you go

00:52:46.190 --> 00:52:48.420
The moment you touched my face,

00:52:49.130 --> 00:52:52.060
I decided never to let you go

00:53:00.600 --> 00:53:03.750
His name was So
...the liberation of slaves enslaved during conflicts between warring clans...

00:53:03.750 --> 00:53:05.880
Gwangjong was a fair and wise emperor

00:53:07.120 --> 00:53:08.770
...deep feeling of guilt...

00:53:16.390 --> 00:53:20.700
Now you won't be recorded
in history as a "bloody ruler"

00:53:20.700 --> 00:53:22.610
I will help you

00:53:26.070 --> 00:53:39.430
The flower will fall to the ground, it withered

00:53:40.060 --> 00:53:53.330
He will be all alone, so sad

00:53:53.900 --> 00:54:07.270
The sky will lose its stars, it will instantly become sad

00:53:59.220 --> 00:54:00.540
I'm sorry

00:54:04.910 --> 00:54:07.370
Sorry for leaving you alone

00:54:07.980 --> 00:54:21.720
And suddenly it starts crying like a little rain

00:54:21.720 --> 00:54:35.110
It feels like a flower blooms and then withers

00:54:25.280 --> 00:54:26.590
Sorry...

00:54:28.740 --> 00:54:30.100
Sorry...

00:54:35.640 --> 00:54:50.070
Tell me with the wind, please

00:54:37.800 --> 00:54:39.600
Sorry...

00:54:55.930 --> 00:54:57.290
Our 8th brother...

00:54:59.790 --> 00:55:00.950
passed away

00:55:06.880 --> 00:55:11.040
I have no one else to see, so I'll leave again

00:55:12.070 --> 00:55:25.470
With the appearance of snow, all dreams will come true

00:55:14.400 --> 00:55:15.910
Take care of yourself

00:55:26.050 --> 00:55:39.950
With all my heart I believe so, they are sincere

00:55:39.950 --> 00:55:53.570
Do you know my heart that it always waits like this?

00:55:53.910 --> 00:56:09.770
If so, come back

00:56:09.400 --> 00:56:10.770
Life is fleeting

00:56:15.340 --> 00:56:19.180
Emperor Taejo's last words were that life is fleeting.

00:56:19.180 --> 00:56:22.050
She's fragile and vain

00:56:23.210 --> 00:56:25.530
He said life is so short

00:56:28.170 --> 00:56:30.460
But I think he was wrong

00:56:32.490 --> 00:56:35.930
You and I are together
so how can it be in vain?

00:56:39.940 --> 00:56:42.220
When I see you I

00:56:43.720 --> 00:56:47.030
I can’t breathe, I’m timid

00:56:47.220 --> 00:56:50.820
It's as if everything in the world has stopped

00:56:52.730 --> 00:56:55.180
I always get nervous when you get that look on your face.

00:56:53.120 --> 00:56:57.720
If I pass by like a breeze,

00:56:55.990 --> 00:56:58.140
I feel like you're going to leave me and go away

00:56:57.720 --> 00:57:00.820
you won't even notice

00:56:59.810 --> 00:57:03.250
What are you afraid of? What are you hiding?

00:57:01.520 --> 00:57:06.120
My heart is all given to you

00:57:06.480 --> 00:57:07.780
Just...

00:57:08.020 --> 00:57:14.120
But loving you is very painful for me

00:57:09.400 --> 00:57:12.600
Living here I worry every day

00:57:14.120 --> 00:57:16.320
And so sad

00:57:14.510 --> 00:57:16.610
Every step I take...

00:57:16.320 --> 00:57:20.820
I need to cross you out of my heart

00:57:17.520 --> 00:57:20.260
I feel like I should be careful
It's like I'm walking on thin ice

00:57:22.120 --> 00:57:23.720
so hard

00:57:22.420 --> 00:57:24.380
Sometimes I feel like I can't breathe

00:57:25.750 --> 00:57:27.370
Even if you have me?

00:57:25.920 --> 00:57:30.020
Don't forget, please!

00:57:28.620 --> 00:57:29.900
Do you still feel that way?

00:57:30.890 --> 00:57:35.320
That eternal love of mine

00:57:33.510 --> 00:57:38.980
If we met in another world and at another time...

00:57:38.980 --> 00:57:42.700
I thought about how wonderful it would be

00:57:43.120 --> 00:57:45.880
By the will of fate

00:57:44.180 --> 00:57:46.320
If only this were possible...

00:57:45.880 --> 00:57:53.140
Suddenly I will be able to meet you!

00:57:47.440 --> 00:57:50.220
I wouldn't be afraid of anything

00:57:51.020 --> 00:57:52.670
I could openly...

00:57:55.280 --> 00:57:59.730
All I wanted was to love you freely

00:57:56.090 --> 00:58:01.540
And it’s still just as difficult for me to forget you

00:58:02.140 --> 00:58:04.300
It's so hard for me

00:58:04.300 --> 00:58:10.840
This dream is bad, when I remember, I cry

00:58:10.840 --> 00:58:11.930
always

00:58:14.150 --> 00:58:17.640
I believe once upon a time

00:58:18.840 --> 00:58:22.440
how I want to love

00:58:24.190 --> 00:58:25.640
I can

00:58:34.650 --> 00:58:37.350
If we are from different worlds...

00:58:38.150 --> 00:58:40.180
I will find you

00:58:42.320 --> 00:58:46.120
My... Su

00:59:03.410 --> 00:59:05.280
My knee hurts a little

00:59:11.640 --> 00:59:18.140
Another place and another time here, but I believe, you are my love

00:59:12.490 --> 00:59:14.300
Come on, get on your back

00:59:14.880 --> 00:59:16.180
Get up!

00:59:16.180 --> 00:59:17.500
It's okay

00:59:18.140 --> 00:59:24.040
A fair wind will bring your scent, it’s so easy for me to recognize it

00:59:24.240 --> 00:59:27.040
But I don't understand

00:59:24.330 --> 00:59:25.670
Let's go!

00:59:26.540 --> 00:59:28.480
- Let's begin!
- Okay

00:59:27.040 --> 00:59:30.940
When did you settle in my heart, tell me

00:59:28.480 --> 00:59:31.110
- Let's run!
- Forward!

00:59:30.940 --> 00:59:33.440
I don't understand

00:59:32.560 --> 00:59:42.330
Thanks for watching with us!
Release group MANIA

00:59:32.560 --> 00:59:42.330
http://doramamania.mybb.ru
http://vk.com/doramamania

00:59:33.440 --> 00:59:36.440
Why is my heart beating fast?

00:59:36.440 --> 00:59:42.540
You may suddenly pass by and not notice, have you forgotten me?

00:59:42.780 --> 00:59:49.500
But until you remember me, I will wait for you

00:59:49.930 --> 00:59:51.970
And you're on me...
